{
  "id": 20,
  "name": "return_aware_cluster_center",
  "intent": "Softens the parent's return and regret coefficients (0.30→0.22, 0.15→0.12, 0.25→0.22, 1.5→1.4) so the new term has room to act without overpowering the nearest-neighbor anchor. Keeps the parent lookahead ratio but adds 0.08·cd·(nr/mr) which boosts candidates that sit inside dense clusters with low relative nearest-to-mean-remaining distance, encouraging the tour to visit cluster centers early. Preserves the return-aware character by keeping rd with mild progress scaling.",
  "tags": [
    "return_aware",
    "cluster"
  ],
  "code": "def priority(f):\n    d = f['distance']\n    rd = f['return_distance']\n    nr = f['nearest_remaining']\n    mr = f['mean_remaining']\n    r = f['regret']\n    p = f['progress']\n    cd = f['cluster_density']\n    s = -d + 0.22 * rd * (1 + 0.45 * p) + (0.12 + 0.22 * (p ** 1.4)) * r + 0.04 * nr / (d + 0.15 + 1e-9) + 0.08 * cd * nr / (mr + 1e-9)\n    return s",
